<title>USA: Fannie Mae ups REMIC 1997-15 to $814 mln.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae ups REMIC 1997-15 to $814 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae said it added about $364 million to a previously issued series of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1997-15, issued via Morgan Stanley, was increased to $814 million from $450 million, Fannie Mae said.</p>
<p>The issue is backed by 30-year, 7.5 percent mortgage-backed securities and various Fannie Mae relocation and adjustable-rate mortgage certificates, the agency said. It has a settlement of March 28.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
